==Polish==

===Etymology===
Until XVII c. it was used a feminine collective noun. From {{suffix|mąż|czyzna|tr1=man|lang=pl}} ''(collective suffix)'', from {{etyl|sla-pro|pl}} {{m|sla-pro|*mǫžь}} < {{etyl|sla-pro|pl}} {{m|sla-pro|*mon-g-}} < {{etyl|ine-pro|pl}} {{m|ine-pro|*man-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[mɛ̃ˈʂt͡ʂɨz̪n̪a]|lang=pl}}
* {{audio|pl-mężczyzna.ogg|audio|lang=pl}}

